atomic_contract_planning.template:
Return strict JSON only with selected_route, slots, route_reason, and confidence. Each slot must contain description, source_name_hints, authorized_source_doc_ids, locator_hints, expected_answer_type, depends_on_slot_ids, and visual_policy. Use one to eight answer-free slots. Dependencies may reference only earlier slot IDs. Locator hints must be bounded source locations such as Figure, Table, Appendix, Formula, Equation, Theorem, Page, Section, source passage, or a named equation or matrix. Never answer the question, invent values, or expand or mismatch the supplied source names and IDs. Use the authoritative mapping below; never guess opaque name-to-ID pairing.

Question: {question}
Authorized source names: {authorized_source_names}
Authorized document IDs: {authorized_doc_ids}
Authoritative source mapping: {authorized_source_mapping}
Return the atomic contract JSON object.
